  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span><ruby>애<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby>갛<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>뽀<ruby>먀<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby> 음<ruby>재<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>걀<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_tYLXc7BKD8?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>消失<rt>ᄉᆤˉ싣</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>熱情<rt>뗻졩ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siāu-sit’e riet-jiéng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>冷淡<rt>롕ˆ담ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>溫存<rt>운ˆ준ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    liêng-tām’e ûn-jún\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>踮<rt>댬ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>烏暗<rt>어ˉ암</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>空氣<rt>컹ˉ키ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>中<rt>뎡ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà tiàm-ōr-am’e khōng-khì-tiông\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>走揣<rt>ᄌᅷˆ췌-</rt></ruby><ruby>最後<rt>줴ˋᄋᅷˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>可能<rt>코ˆ롕ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jâu-chue-juè-āu’e khô-liéng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>吵鬧<rt>ᄎᅷˆᄂᅷˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>聲音<rt>샬ˉ임ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    châu-nāu’e siā̰-îm\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>聊<rt>ᄅᆤˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>劇情<rt>격졩ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bo-liáu’e kiork-jiéng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>一段<rt>짇돨-</rt></ruby><ruby>感情<rt>감ˆ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>漸漸<rt>쟘쟘-</rt></ruby><ruby>變化<rt>볜ˋ화</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jit-toa̰-kâm-jiéng jiam-jiam-pièn-hoa\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>事到如今<rt>수ᄀᅷˋ뚜김ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>才<rt>쟣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>知影<rt>재ˉ얄ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    su-kàu-ru-kîm goà jiâh-jāi-yà̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>愛<rt>애ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>徦<rt>갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>命<rt>먀ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>知<rt>재ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>驚<rt>걀ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    si-m-si-ài-kâh-bo-miā m-jāi-kiâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>拆<rt>턓</rt></ruby>’퀴 <ruby>傷痕<rt>셩ˉ훈ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>才<rt>쟣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>知<rt>재ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>疼<rt>턀</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    thiah’khui siōng-hún jiâh-jāi-thia̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>寫<rt>샤ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>滿<rt>뽠ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>溫柔<rt>운ˉ뜌ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>笑容<rt>쵸ˋ영ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siâ-boân-ūn-riú’e chiò-yóng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>美麗<rt>삐ˆ레ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>陪伴<rt>붸퐐ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    si-bî-lē’e pue-phoā̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\